43)[0m Substituting \(z\) and \(\frac{1}{z}\) into the expression, we get:[36m(TaskRunner pid=22143)[0m \[[36m(TaskRunner pid=22143)[0m (75 + 117i)z + \frac{96 + 144i}{z} = (75 + 117i)4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta) + (96 + 144i)\frac{1}{4}(\cos\theta - i\sin\theta).[36m(TaskRunner pid=22143)[0m \][36m(TaskRunner pid=22143)[0m Simplifying the expression, we have:[36m(TaskRunner pid=22143)[0m \[[36m(TaskRunner pid=22143)[0m (75 + 117i)4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta) = 4(75\cos\theta + 75i\sin\theta + 117i\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta) = 4(75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta + i(75\sin\theta + 117\cos\theta)),[36m(TaskRunner pid=22143)[0m \][36m(TaskRunner pid=22143)[0m and[36m(TaskRunner pid=22143)[0m \[[36m(TaskRunner pid=22143)[0m (96 + 144i)\frac{1}{4}(\cos\theta - i\sin\theta) = \frac{1}{4}(96\cos\theta - 96i\sin\theta + 144i\cos\theta + 144\sin\theta) = \frac{1}{4}(96\cos\theta + 144\sin\theta + i(144\cos\theta - 96\sin\theta)).[36m(TaskRunner pid=22143)[0m \][36m(TaskRunner pid=22143)[0m Combining these, the expression becomes:[36m(TaskRunner pid=22143)[0m \[[36m(TaskRunner pid=22143)[0m 4(75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta + i(75\sin\theta + 117\cos\theta)) + \frac{1}{4}(96\cos\theta + 144\sin\theta + i(144\cos\theta - 96\sin\theta)).[36m(TaskRunner pid=22143)[0m \][36m(TaskRunner pid=22143)[0m Separating the real and imaginary parts, we get:[36m(TaskRunner pid=22143)[0m \[[36m(TaskRunner pid=22143)[0m \text{Real part} = 4(75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta) + \frac{1}{4}(96\cos\theta + 144\sin\theta) = 300\cos\theta - 468\sin\theta + 24\cos\theta + 36\sin\theta = 324\cos\theta - 432\sin\theta.[36m(TaskRunner pid=22143)[0m \][36m(TaskRunner pid=22143)[0m To maximize the real part, we need to maximize the expression \(324\cos\theta - 432\sin\theta\). This is of the form \(R\cos(\theta + \phi)\) where \(R = \sqrt{324^2 + 432^2}\). The maximum value of \(R\cos(\theta + \phi)\) is \(R\), so we calculate \(R\):[36m(TaskRunner pid=22